y fire or recon pings.\n* **Use Cover:** Never run out in the open. Move from cover to cover and peek around corners using \"mounting\" (resting your gun on a wall/ledge) to reduce recoil.\n* **Listen for Audio:** Footsteps give away enemy positions. Using headphones provides a major tactical advantage.",
