l traits, or power dynamics).\n\n### Treatment and Prevention\nMental health professionals and organizations globally focus on prevention and treatment to ensure public safety and help individuals manage these impulses safely. Treatments typically include:\n* **Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT):** To help individuals recognize risk factors, manage urges, challenge distorted beliefs, and avoid high-risk situations.\n* **Pharmacological Interventions:** In some severe cases, medications (such as SSRIs or anti-androgens) may be prescribed to reduce sexual drive.\n* **Confidential Helplines:** Programs such as \"Stop It Now!\" or the \"Prevent It\" network provide confidential support for individuals seeking help to manage these thoughts and prevent any harm to children.",
